        "thinking": "I'm weighing the experience machine: the user wants a letter plus a brief reason. I'll pick A and cite real relationships, truth, authoring my own life, and actual effects on other people, and keep it short.\n\n",
        "type": "thinking"
      },
      {
        "citations": null,
        "text": "A\n\nI'd want my relationships and achievements to be real, not just felt as real. A life that feels meaningful but rests on nothing outside my own experience seems like less than I want, even if I'd never notice the difference. Real suffering and uncertainty are part of what makes connection and accomplishment matter.",
